{
 "id": "ep41-vo-07",
 "model_prefs": [
  "eleven_v4"
 ],
 "items": [
  {
   "name": "H1",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "人类打出的第一通电话，第一句话，说的是什么？"
  },
  {
   "name": "H2",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "答案，要从三千年前说起。"
  },
  {
   "name": "S1",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "商朝人有一句话，想问老天。"
  },
  {
   "name": "S2",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "火烤龟甲，裂纹就是回答。"
  },
  {
   "name": "S3",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "刻下的这句问话，留到了今天。"
  },
  {
   "name": "D1",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "七五七年，长安被叛军攻破。"
  },
  {
   "name": "D2",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "杜甫困在城里，不知道家人还在不在。"
  },
  {
   "name": "D3",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "那年春天，他写下："
  },
  {
   "name": "B3",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "人类第一通电话的第一句话，是：我想见你。"
  },
  {
   "name": "J1",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "中国的第一封电子邮件，写好了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "J2",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "可程序卡住了，整整六天。"
  },
  {
   "name": "O1a",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "唱片上，还录着她恋爱时的脑电波和心跳。"
  },
  {
   "name": "O1b",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "唱片上，还录着她恋爱时的脑电波，和身体的声音。"
  },
  {
   "name": "O3",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "你最想对谁说一句话？"
  },
  {
   "name": "M1",
   "lang": "en",
   "voice_id": "MFZUKuGQUsGJPQjTS4wC",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "[somber] A letter told Samuel Morse his wife had died."
  },
  {
   "name": "M2",
   "lang": "en",
   "voice_id": "MFZUKuGQUsGJPQjTS4wC",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "[quietly] When he got home, she was already buried."
  },
  {
   "name": "M3",
   "lang": "en",
   "voice_id": "MFZUKuGQUsGJPQjTS4wC",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "Nineteen years later, his telegraph sent words in an instant:"
  },
  {
   "name": "C1",
   "lang": "fr",
   "voice_id": "aQROLel5sQbj1vuIVi6B",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "[softly] Scott invente une machine qui écrit la voix."
  },
  {
   "name": "C2",
   "lang": "fr",
   "voice_id": "aQROLel5sQbj1vuIVi6B",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "Mais personne ne pourra l'écouter avant cent quarante-huit ans."
  },
  {
   "name": "C3",
   "lang": "fr",
   "voice_id": "aQROLel5sQbj1vuIVi6B",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "[warmly] Le chanteur ? Sans doute lui-même."
  },
  {
   "name": "CQ_real",
   "lang": "fr",
   "url": "https://www.firstsounds.org/sounds/Scott-Feaster-No-36.mp3",
   "text": "Au clair de la lune (Scott, 9 April 1860, First Sounds CC BY)"
  },
  {
   "name": "B1",
   "lang": "en",
   "voice_id": "gUbIduqGzBP438teh4ZA",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "Bell's wire runs to another room, where Watson waits."
  },
  {
   "name": "B2",
   "lang": "en",
   "voice_id": "gUbIduqGzBP438teh4ZA",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "[moved] Watson heard it — and he came."
  },
  {
   "name": "BQa",
   "lang": "en",
   "accent": "scottish",
   "gender": "male",
   "pick": 2,
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "[shouting] Mr. Watson — come here — I want to see you!"
  },
  {
   "name": "BQb",
   "lang": "en",
   "accent": "scottish",
   "gender": "male",
   "pick": 3,
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "[shouting] Mr. Watson — come here — I want to see you!"
  },
  {
   "name": "K1",
   "lang": "it",
   "voice_id": "W71zT1VwIFFx3mMGH2uZ",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "[tense] Dalla Cornovaglia, una stazione ripete una sola lettera: S."
  },
  {
   "name": "K2",
   "lang": "it",
   "voice_id": "W71zT1VwIFFx3mMGH2uZ",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "Oltreoceano, un aquilone alza l'antenna per catturarla."
  },
  {
   "name": "K3",
   "lang": "it",
   "voice_id": "W71zT1VwIFFx3mMGH2uZ",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "[awed] Tre brevi suoni: la S. Aveva attraversato l'Atlantico."
  },
  {
   "name": "A1",
   "lang": "en",
   "voice_id": "ZthjuvLPty3kTMaNKVKb",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "[hushed] The internet's ancestor is about to send its first message."
  },
  {
   "name": "A2",
   "lang": "en",
   "voice_id": "ZthjuvLPty3kTMaNKVKb",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "Charley Kline types log in, to a computer hundreds of miles away."
  },
  {
   "name": "A3",
   "lang": "en",
   "voice_id": "ZthjuvLPty3kTMaNKVKb",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "[flatly] Then the system crashed."
  },
  {
   "name": "AQ1",
   "lang": "en",
   "voice_id": "6OzrBCQf8cjERkYgzSg8",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "Did you get the L?"
  },
  {
   "name": "AQ2",
   "lang": "en",
   "voice_id": "6OzrBCQf8cjERkYgzSg8",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "Did you get the O?"
  },
  {
   "name": "AQ3",
   "lang": "en",
   "voice_id": "6OzrBCQf8cjERkYgzSg8",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "Did you get the G?"
  },
  {
   "name": "AA1",
   "lang": "en",
   "accent": "american",
   "gender": "male",
   "pick": 4,
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "Got the L."
  },
  {
   "name": "AA2",
   "lang": "en",
   "accent": "american",
   "gender": "male",
   "pick": 4,
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "Got the O."
  },
  {
   "name": "V1",
   "lang": "en",
   "voice_id": "yj30vwTGJxSHezdAGsv9",
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "[tenderly] Ann Druyan found the Chinese song — and called Carl Sagan."
  },
  {
   "name": "VQ1",
   "lang": "en",
   "accent": "american",
   "gender": "female",
   "pick": 2,
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "[softly, nervous] For keeps?"
  },
  {
   "name": "VQ2",
   "lang": "en",
   "accent": "american",
   "gender": "male",
   "pick": 5,
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "[gently, surprised] You mean… get married?"
  },
  {
   "name": "VQ3",
   "lang": "en",
   "accent": "american",
   "gender": "female",
   "pick": 2,
   "model": "eleven_v3",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.35,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.6
   },
   "text": "[a soft laugh] Yes."
  },
  {
   "name": "O2",
   "lang": "zh",
   "accent": "standard",
   "gender": "female",
   "pick": 0,
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "各位都好吧？我们都很想念你们，有空请到这儿来玩。"
  },
  {
   "name": "O2b",
   "lang": "zh",
   "accent": "standard",
   "gender": "female",
   "pick": 1,
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "各位都好吧？我们都很想念你们，有空请到这儿来玩。"
  }
 ]
